OL,3,GNEWSA'Extraordinary' sighting of rare
OL,4,Abird of prey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bird watcher has described the "truly
OL,7,Fextraordinary" moment he spotted a rare
OL,8,Fbird of prey in flight over a Hampshire
OL,9,Fbeauty spot.
OL,11,FThe pallid harrier was photographed at
OL,12,FTestwood Lakes Nature Reserve near
OL,13,FSouthampton in April 2025.
OL,15,FThe sighting by Hampshire and Isle of
OL,16,FWight Wildlife Trust's Simon King has
OL,17,Fnow been confirmed by the British Birds
OL,18,FRarities Committee (BBRC).
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
