OL,3,GNEWSA'Extraordinary' sighting of rare
OL,4,Abird of prey
OL,5,
OL,6,FPallid harriers, which breed mainly in
OL,7,FEastern Europe and Central Asia, are
OL,8,Fexceptionally rare visitors to the UK.
OL,9,FKing said it was a "once in a lifetime
OL,10,Fmoment".
